     2074             .
     2075             for each buf_temp-browse-handle
     2076               where buf_temp-browse-handle.browse-type = 'width':u
     2077             on error undo, next
     2078             :
     2079               assign
     2080                 buf_temp-browse-handle.browse-handle :width = buf_temp-browse-handle.original-size
     2081               .
